# AGENTS.md

- Project uses Next.js 16.3 (App Router)
- Prefer official docs for this version
- Use Server Components by default
- `params`, `searchParams`, `cookies()`, `headers()` must be awaited
- Package manager: npm
- For user project preferences, follow [`.cursor/rules/preferences.mdc`](preferences.mdc).
- For code comments, follow [`.cursor/rules/comments.mdc`](comments.mdc).
- For subagent routing, follow [`.cursor/rules/agents.mdc`](agents.mdc).
